---
import Layout from '../layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Read the terms that apply when you browse our storefront, create an account, place an order, or use our services."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
    <header class="text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-secondary uppercase">
        Last updated September 14, 2026
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-tight font-bold text-text">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        These terms describe the rules that apply when you visit our storefront,
        create an account, purchase products, or otherwise use our services.
        Please read them carefully before placing an order.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-12 text-left text-text-secondary">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Agreement to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          By accessing or using this storefront, you agree to these Terms and
          Conditions and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not
          use the site or submit an order. These terms apply to visitors,
          account holders, and customers and form an agreement between you and
          the business operating this storefront.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Additional terms may be shown for a particular product, promotion, or
          service. Those additional terms become part of this agreement when you
          use the relevant offering. If they conflict with these general terms,
          the more specific terms apply to that offering.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Accounts and Eligibility</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          You must be legally able to enter into a binding agreement in your
          location to make a purchase. You are responsible for providing
          accurate, current information and for keeping your account credentials
          secure. Purchases must be completed through an authenticated customer
          account; guest checkout is not available.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          You are responsible for activity under your account and should contact
          us promptly if you suspect unauthorized access. We may suspend or
          close an account where reasonably necessary to protect customers,
          investigate misuse, comply with law, or enforce these terms. Account
          closure does not remove obligations relating to orders already placed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Products and Availability</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We aim to describe and display products accurately, including their
          materials, dimensions, colors, and features. Screen settings and
          natural variation may affect how a product looks, and minor
          differences do not necessarily mean an item is defective. Please
          review the product page and care information before purchasing.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Products and quantities may change without notice. Adding an item to a
          cart does not reserve it, and availability is confirmed only when we
          accept the order. We may set purchase limits or withdraw a product
          when needed for inventory, safety, legal, or other operational
          reasons.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          Orders, Pricing, and Payment
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Submitting an order is an offer to purchase the items shown at
          checkout. An automated acknowledgement confirms that we received your
          request; it does not mean the order has been accepted. We may decline
          or cancel an order because of stock issues, suspected fraud, payment
          problems, pricing errors, delivery restrictions, or limits on
          quantities.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Prices are shown in the currency indicated on the storefront. Taxes,
          delivery charges, duties, or similar costs are displayed where they
          can be calculated and may be added at checkout. You authorize our
          payment provider to charge the selected payment method for the final
          amount. If a clear pricing or product error affects your order, we
          will contact you before proceeding or issue a refund if payment has
          already been collected.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Shipping and Delivery</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Available delivery methods, estimated timeframes, and charges are
          presented during checkout. Estimates begin after an order is accepted
          and are not guarantees. Carrier delays, severe weather, customs
          processing, remote destinations, and other events outside our
          reasonable control may affect arrival times.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          You are responsible for providing a complete delivery address and for
          reviewing it before submitting the order. Contact us as soon as
          possible if an address needs correction. Once an order has entered
          fulfillment, rerouting may not be possible and extra carrier charges
          may apply where permitted.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Returns and Refunds</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Return eligibility depends on the item, its condition, the reason for
          return, and any rights provided by applicable consumer law. Before
          sending an item back, contact us with your order details so we can
          confirm the available options and provide instructions. Items returned
          without authorization may take longer to process.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Approved refunds are generally issued to the original payment method
          after the returned item is received and inspected. Processing time may
          vary by financial institution. These terms do not exclude, restrict,
          or modify consumer guarantees or remedies that cannot lawfully be
          excluded in your jurisdiction.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          You may use the storefront only for lawful personal or business
          shopping purposes. You must not interfere with site operation, bypass
          security controls, introduce malicious code, scrape the site at an
          unreasonable rate, impersonate another person, use fraudulent payment
          information, or attempt to access accounts or systems without
          authorization.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Reviews, messages, and other content you submit must be accurate and
          must not be unlawful, abusive, deceptive, infringing, or harmful. You
          retain ownership of your content but grant us permission to host,
          reproduce, and display it as needed to operate and promote the
          service, subject to our Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          The storefront and its text, graphics, photographs, logos, product
          presentation, and software are owned by us or used with permission and
          are protected by intellectual property laws. We grant you a limited,
          revocable, non-transferable right to access the storefront for its
          intended purpose. No ownership rights transfer to you.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          You may not copy, modify, distribute, sell, license, reverse engineer,
          or create derivative works from protected storefront content except
          where the law expressly permits it or you have written permission from
          the relevant rights holder.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">
          Disclaimers and Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We work to keep the storefront accurate, secure, and available, but
          online services may occasionally contain errors or experience
          interruptions. To the extent permitted by law, the site is provided on
          an “as available” basis, and we do not promise uninterrupted or
          error-free access.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Nothing in these terms excludes liability or customer rights that
          cannot legally be excluded. Where liability can be limited, we are not
          responsible for indirect, consequential, or special losses that were
          not reasonably foreseeable when the agreement was made. Our
          responsibility for a product remains subject to applicable consumer
          law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We may revise these terms to reflect changes to our products,
          services, operations, or legal obligations. The latest version will
          appear on this page with its effective date. Changes apply from that
          date and do not retroactively alter an order already accepted unless
          required by law or agreed with you.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          If part of these terms is found unenforceable, the remaining
          provisions continue to apply. A delay in enforcing a right does not
          waive it. Questions, concerns, and formal notices about these terms
          can be sent through our contact page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl bg-surface p-8 text-center md:p-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Questions about these terms?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
        Contact us before placing an order if you need help understanding any
        part of these terms.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-action px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-action-hover"
      >
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
